                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1579486a-beec-37e0-b612-fa6e5aa5e03f",
                        "entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прочно присоединить, приделать что-либо к чему-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8d128eb-ba40-4ca2-abd4-9cdfe8616066",
                                "sense_id": "1579486a-beec-37e0-b612-fa6e5aa5e03f",
                                "text": "Голова лошади была на винтах прикреплена к туловищу лошади, так что лошадь довольно легко могла двигать головой, и получалось это естественно, потому что и шея и винты были скрыты под густой гривой."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "94556bd5-9b74-3a65-8dfb-c69782257551",
                        "entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. заставить остаться на каком-либо месте"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "30b8cb28-7492-3a4a-a105-d8036e481c26",
                        "entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. поставить в зависимое положение, закабалить (крестьян)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4cad9694-0693-304b-aed7-c64d2d4027a9",
                        "entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. возложить на кого-либо, что-либо какие-либо обязанности, передать в чьё-либо ведение"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8a0b4f57-353d-31b9-a90b-9737d59d2068",
                        "entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. зарегистрировать где-либо для какого-либо обслуживания, использования"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ebff3033-f5f7-43b2-bcb0-c0c9482fb650",
                                "sense_id": "8a0b4f57-353d-31b9-a90b-9737d59d2068",
                                "text": "Полагаем, что переводы в режиме online со временем станут доступны отправителям, имеющим счёт в любом банке, прикреплённый к пластиковой карточке одной из известных платёжных систем."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a547439c-8d24-45dd-9a0f-bab532add6a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "a5fb22eb-ef6d-3c03-9802-4929e452fe25",
                        "target_lang_word": "attach",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "attach",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fasten, to join to (literally and figuratively)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60b72dbf-37b4-4ee6-86b8-e46f08ab9ce0",
                                                "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                                "text": "You need to attach the carabiner to your harness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e0c2f08-29ca-493c-969d-527306b9a8fc",
                                                "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                                "text": "An officer is attached to a certain regiment, company, or ship."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6b2958e-73ed-4ad8-9ba7-313c145c8818",
                                                "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                                "text": "The shoulder blade is […] attached only to the muscles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ce923ca-a203-49eb-ab57-1a28f3663a95",
                                                "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                                "text": "A huge stone, to which the cable on the left bank was attached, was removed years later"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc18a300-b1c5-489f-802d-d5b1dea639fd",
                                                "sense_id": "a9a6534f-8c3e-3d74-b609-3716006df2dc",
                                                "text": "Turbines have been around for a long time—windmills and water wheels are early examples. The name comes from the Latin turbo, meaning vortex, and thus the defining property of a turbine is that a fluid or gas turns the blades of a rotor, which is attached to a shaft that can perform useful work."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7a136514-3708-398d-905d-7775c23f77cb",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adhere; to be attached."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "163e53f6-0eb3-4fe1-8b89-7b397a5855c3",
                                                "sense_id": "7a136514-3708-398d-905d-7775c23f77cb",
                                                "text": "The great interest which attaches to the mere knowledge of these facts cannot be doubted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6d39e20-9784-34ed-96bc-d9489c76a568",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To include an attachment with a communication (especially an email or other electronic communication)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "024bb100-ec69-404f-889f-d2c6234e2b36",
                                                "sense_id": "b6d39e20-9784-34ed-96bc-d9489c76a568",
                                                "text": "I've attached the contract to this email."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "845426b8-549e-367c-a9ac-14cdf0741ecd",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To come into legal operation in connection with anything; to vest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "703b1589-7191-4374-938d-19db346e0f71",
                                                "sense_id": "845426b8-549e-367c-a9ac-14cdf0741ecd",
                                                "text": "Dower will attach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e2995d9-f0f8-4e05-873f-f8f10e72ef10",
                                                "sense_id": "845426b8-549e-367c-a9ac-14cdf0741ecd",
                                                "text": "it therefore becomes important to know at what time the lien for taxes will attach."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffcaddce-801e-33c9-86fd-3023c1f3ee72",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To win the heart of; to connect by ties of love or self-interest; to attract; to fasten or bind by moral influence; with to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca71464e-8ddd-4994-a84c-d1bc6609e92a",
                                                "sense_id": "ffcaddce-801e-33c9-86fd-3023c1f3ee72",
                                                "text": "incapable of attaching a sensible man"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3374cc88-d211-490d-ba1e-b993c124adf7",
                                                "sense_id": "ffcaddce-801e-33c9-86fd-3023c1f3ee72",
                                                "text": "God […] by various ties attaches man to man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58fb3db4-af81-4db4-b023-8a4e6290ec4c",
                                                "sense_id": "ffcaddce-801e-33c9-86fd-3023c1f3ee72",
                                                "text": "attached to a friend; attaching others to us by wealth or flattery"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3da8171f-4cec-3fcf-aebe-d09b0791bb06",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To connect, in a figurative sense; to ascribe or attribute; to affix; with to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c470c484-7097-4da1-ad21-0eb92b43dc1f",
                                                "sense_id": "3da8171f-4cec-3fcf-aebe-d09b0791bb06",
                                                "text": "to attach great importance to a particular circumstance"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d5271cc-fdc2-4721-889e-b66c852ef7da",
                                                "sense_id": "3da8171f-4cec-3fcf-aebe-d09b0791bb06",
                                                "text": "To this treasure a curse is attached."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9764258b-03c6-33cd-811e-9bfffb3bb92f",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take, seize, or lay hold of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f38b92d-4d9b-4ca4-9b2b-36c8a7d41637",
                                                "sense_id": "9764258b-03c6-33cd-811e-9bfffb3bb92f",
                                                "text": "Then homeward every man attach the hand / Of his fair mistress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64b32a5b-f1ed-3e18-9727-1fd7d99d8131",
                                        "entry_id": "ca8eecac-aaec-37f8-8f11-03f3c736b954",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To arrest, seize."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aabe204-d0bf-4000-ba2d-cf8298f3507b",
                                                "sense_id": "64b32a5b-f1ed-3e18-9727-1fd7d99d8131",
                                                "text": "Eftsoones the Gard, which on his state did wait, / Attacht that faitor false, and bound him strait […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be847a9b-4d99-4bc0-8872-333986ccb324",
                                                "sense_id": "64b32a5b-f1ed-3e18-9727-1fd7d99d8131",
                                                "text": "Old lord, I cannot blame thee, / Who am myself attach'd with weariness / To th' dulling of my spirits: sit down, and rest."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c20fd90b-f6ef-4747-a668-da838bb5b355",
                                                "sense_id": "64b32a5b-f1ed-3e18-9727-1fd7d99d8131",
                                                "text": "The earl marshal attached Gloucester for high treason."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
